{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And they were in his eyes like a few days.</b> A small thing it was in his eyes to work for her seven years, because of his great love for her; and if Laban had asked more, Jacob would have worked. Another interpretation: after he had worked, they were in his eyes like a few days, but at the time of the work they were in his eyes like many days, because of his love for her."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:35.453906945Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}